From 99b8202d0ff5f4b91f7afa3cb58e0e24c085718d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 12:08:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Visual redesign: ledger-teal accent, IBM Plex Sans/Mono
 (bundled), dark run rail, hairline flow steps

Replaces the generic blue/rounded-card look. One accent, 4px radii,
numbers in Plex Mono, sentence-case labels throughout, step numbers on
the flow, status as a pill, run facts as discrete items instead of
dot-joined strings. Fonts ship with the app (no network at runtime).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
